	 * @param omitLinkedObjectsIfPossible omit prefetching of linked objects, if
	 *        this is possible (no attributes of the linked objects need to be
	 *        prefetched)
	 * @throws CMSUnavailableException
	 * @throws NodeIllegalArgumentException
